======================================RXjs Notes========================
RXjs -  Reactive extenstion of Javascript. its an reactive library to manage the state.
        so it used to handle the asynchronous data streams (data that arrives over time) using 
        Observables and operators.
        When we create an Observable and subscribe to it, the Observable pushes values to the subscriber whenever new data is emitted.     

        RxJS itself does not handle DOM updates or change detection.
        In Angular, when an Observable emits a value, Angular’s change detection may run (via Zone.js or async pipe) and update the DOM.

Reactive - Respond when somethign happened / if any dynamic value comes reactive occordingly

Non - Reactive - You ask again and again " Has somethign is changed " Ex: open wats app - No msg , Open again and see - no msg
Reacive exaplme here is - watas app notification - once received , open app and see msg.

